error: a field of this state type carries no durability tier (AC-160; ADR-0109 decision 2). Every field must be declared `tier1 <name>: <type>` or `tier2 <name>: <type>`. tier1 is decision-bearing and written to git first; tier2 is EventStore-only and rebuildable or disposable. The test is: if the database were deleted, would `redkiln run` take a different next action? Which tier a field belongs in is a design judgement no instrument settles -- but answering is not optional.
